{
  "name": "05 - Client Intake and Welcome Email",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 05 - Client Intake and Welcome Email\nA client submits the form (or run Manual Test with pinned sample data). The data is cleaned and validated, checked against the sheet for duplicates, saved as a new row, a short Arabic welcome email is written by AI and sent, and you get a Telegram notification. Invalid and duplicate submissions only notify you.\n\n**Credentials:** Google Sheets OAuth2, Gmail OAuth2, OpenAI API, Telegram Bot API.\n\n**Setup:** set telegramChatId, senderName and businessName in Config. Pick the Document and Sheet (From list) in Find Existing Client and Add Client.\n\n**Sheet columns (row 1):** Client ID, Date, Name, Email, Phone, Service, Notes, Status.\n\n**Form URLs:** open the Client Form node and see the Test URL and Production URL tabs.",
        "height": 420,
        "width": 520,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "54018e34-a80f-406f-8ebf-bd72820cd4e9",
